OL,3,GNEWSAAbusive husband who drove over
OL,4,Awife with his car twice dies in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to murder his estranged
OL,7,Fwife by driving his car over her twice
OL,8,Fhas died in jail.
OL,10,FWilliam Budge, 63, was caught on camera
OL,11,Framming Sandra Budge with his car in
OL,12,FEdinburgh in April 2024, before turning
OL,13,Faround and driving over her again as
OL,14,Fshe lay on the ground.
OL,16,FHe was initially sentenced to seven
OL,17,Fyears and seven months after he pled
OL,18,Fguilty to various charges last year,
OL,19,Fbut the Crown successfully appealed and
OL,20,FBudge was given a jail term of 10 years
OL,21,Fand 10 months.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
